{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31128","headline":"题汉州西湖 · 薛能","name":"题汉州西湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西湖天下名，可以濯吾缨。\n况是携家赏，从妨半驿程。\n尝茶春味渴，断酒晚怀清。\n尽得幽人趣，犹嫌守吏迎。\n重湌逢角暮，百事喜诗成。\n坐阻湘江谪，谁爲话政声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}